<title>USA: Nevada $30 mln housing deal ylds 6.35 pct in 2028.</title>
<headline>Nevada $30 mln housing deal ylds 6.35 pct in 2028.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co said Thursday it tentatively priced $30 million Nevada Housing Division single-family program bonds at a top yield of 6.35 percent in 2028.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
